  "description": "<img width=\"30%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/EDA-logo.png\">\n\nTime series of the column of excess methane from waste in eastern Ukraine. UNEP does not classify this location as a persistent emitter of methane however we have coincident EMIT and Sentinel-2 data showing excess methane emissions on October 7th, 2024. The vertical dot-dashed lines correspond to detected methane plumes from the EMIT satellite.",
